{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Cursed. Your memory is fading, people avoid you, and you're just a nameless drifter taking any job to survive. But you're not alone \u2014 Lina walks beside you, and on your journey, you'll meet others... though whether they become friends or enemies is yet to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/9a01626fac0ad931819034687a0f44a0.poster.avif?t=1766165350\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/9a01626fac0ad931819034687a0f44a0.webm?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/9a01626fac0ad931819034687a0f44a0.mp4?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining character abilities and building the right party is key to victory. Smart builds and synergy between allies determine the outcome of each battle. Every fight tests your tactics and adaptability \u2014 especially in the Challenge Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/e6acb98a68b35c904a68952456510bc3.poster.avif?t=1766165350\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/e6acb98a68b35c904a68952456510bc3.webm?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/e6acb98a68b35c904a68952456510bc3.mp4?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Mini-Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, try your hand at card games \u2014 where you can earn not only gold, but new cards and respect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/d9c74b1bccfe2f056fcb4a9d86a9e7d3.poster.avif?t=1766165350\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/d9c74b1bccfe2f056fcb4a9d86a9e7d3.webm?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/d9c74b1bccfe2f056fcb4a9d86a9e7d3.mp4?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Trade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading is a delicate game of risk and reward. You\u2019ll haggle to raise or lower prices while keeping your opponent calm enough to seal the deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/42f99cfc086001999306e9b6e4e99238.poster.avif?t=1766165350\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/42f99cfc086001999306e9b6e4e99238.webm?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/42f99cfc086001999306e9b6e4e99238.mp4?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816160?t=1766165350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816160?t=1766165350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/f4795cc403c35df2fb7a27085f54f2f23c00a567/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766165350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/f4795cc403c35df2fb7a27085f54f2f23c00a567/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766165350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence and dark themes not suitable for children.\r\n\u2013 depictions of violence, including murder and bloody scenes;\r\n\u2013 themes of psychological pressure, fear, madness, and self-destruction;\r\n\u2013 mentions or implications of abuse and traumatic experiences;\r\n\u2013 strong language;\r\n\u2013 includes elements of a sexual nature, but they are presented as implications and do not contain explicit scenes."},"demos":[{"appid":3964770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Cursed. Your memory is fading, people avoid you, and you're just a nameless drifter taking any job to survive. But you're not alone \u2014 Lina walks beside you, and on your journey, you'll meet others... though whether they become friends or enemies is yet to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/9a01626fac0ad931819034687a0f44a0.poster.avif?t=1766165350\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816160/extras/9a01626fac0ad931819034687a0f44a0.webm?t=1766165350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://